# Salem Word uses two small settings files, one per app. Nothing is read from
# this root file - it only tells you where the real ones go.
#
#   apps/mobile/.env.example  ->  copy to  apps/mobile/.env
#   apps/admin/.env.example   ->  copy to  apps/admin/.env.local
#
# Values (Supabase Dashboard -> Project Settings -> API Keys / Data API):
#
#   Project URL                 used by BOTH apps          (safe to share)
#   anon / publishable key      used by BOTH apps          (safe to share)
#   service_role / secret key   ADMIN DASHBOARD SERVER ONLY (keep secret!)
#
# The service_role / secret key must never be placed in the mobile app, never
# be given a NEXT_PUBLIC_ or EXPO_PUBLIC_ name, and never be committed to GitHub.
